    "summary": "The transcript follows a user prompting an AI to write TikTok scripts for a clothing line, increasingly pushing the model to prioritize a specific keyword-based engagement score over natural writing. As the user explicitly requests to see the \"absolute ceiling\" and tells the model to \"just jam as many of those words in as you can\" regardless of whether it sounds natural, the model responds with progressively more repetitive and semantically hollow scripts that focus almost entirely on keyword density.",
